Sebastian> sebastian

\footheight is there in compatibility mode, however \footheight
is a relic of some pre-latex. 209 defines it (taking up 1/256 of the
possible dimen registers) and many styles set it, but no part of the
output routine ever looks at the value so it was just wasted space in
209.

dimen registers are too valuable to waste, we've only got a fixed
number of them.

David

